    {
      "date_filed": "2014-05-22 14:20:03",
      "description": "MASTER MOTION CALENDAR ON MAY-22-2014 IN 206, PLAINTIFF'S MOTION TO CONTINUE THE TRIAL DATE FROM JUNE 9, 2014 TO SEPTEMBER 8, 2014. KELECHI EMEZIEM APPEARING FOR PLAINTIFF. ELIZABETH PEDERSON APPEARING FOR DEFENDANT CTIY AND COUNTY OF SAN FRANCISCO. AFTER ARGUMENT, THE COURT DENIED PLAINTIFF'S MOTION TO CONTINUE THE TRIAL DATE. THE TRIAL DATE OF 6/9/14 AT 9:30AM IN DEPT. 206 IS MAINTAINED. THE COURT HAVE FOUND PLAINTIFF'S COUNSEL LACK OF CANDOR BY NOT BRINGING UP TO THE COURT'S ATTENTION THAT THE GROUNDS TO CONTINUE THE TRIAL DATE ARE MOOT SINCE THE TWO CASES SCHEDULED FOR TRIAL ON 5/27/14 AND 6/2/14 IN ALAMEDA COUNTY HAVE BEEN CONTINUED. IF PLAINTIFF'S COUNSEL WILL REQUEST FOR ATTORNEY'S FEES AND COSTS FOR PREPRATION OF THE MOTION AND APPEARANCE AT TODAY'S HEARING, THEN PLAINTIFF MAY SCHEDULE A NOTICED MOTION IN DEPT. 206. WRITTEN ORDER PENDING. JUDGE: CYNTHIA M. LEE; CLERK: R. VELUZ; MATTER NOT REPORTED. (206)",
